# Charity Extractor, a french vanilla creature: cast with Black Lotus mana, its characteristics as printed (power, toughness,
# keywords, colors, types, protection), then attacking Bot2, who has no creatures.
# Lifelink (CR 702.15b): Bot1 gains as much life as it deals.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x2
Charity Extractor
Plains x21

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#2.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Charity Extractor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.End]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Charity Extractor.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Charity Extractor.Toughness = 5
? Bot1.Battlefield.Charity Extractor.Keywords = Lifelink
? Bot1.Battlefield.Charity Extractor.Colors = Black
